WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.862 line:88%
1. In Google Cloud Console create a project with any name — no card needed.

2
00:00:04.912 --> 00:00:09.538 line:88%
2. Enable the APIs — the MemuAI wizard has an «Enable all APIs» button.

3
00:00:09.588 --> 00:00:14.274 line:88%
3. Google Auth Platform → Get started: name, email, Audience «External».

4
00:00:14.324 --> 00:00:18.185 line:88%
4. Audience → Test users → Add users: add your own Gmail.

5
00:00:18.235 --> 00:00:22.685 line:88%
5. Clients → Create client → «Desktop app» → Create → Download JSON.

6
00:00:22.735 --> 00:00:28.285 line:88%
Settings → Integrations → Google: the same wizard with links to each step.

7
00:00:28.335 --> 00:00:35.270 line:88%
Paste the Client ID and Client secret — or press «Load JSON».

8
00:00:35.320 --> 00:00:43.070 line:88%
«Save», then «Sign in with Google» and tick every box.
